<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Georgia', 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f5f5; }
    .container { max-width: 700px; margin: 24px auto; background: #fff; border: 2px solid #1a1a1a; padding: 48px; }
    .banner { border: 2px solid #c0392b; background: #fdeaea; color: #922b21; text-align: center; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .header { text-align: center; border-bottom: 3px double #1a1a1a; padding-bottom: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .header h1 { font-size: 20px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 4px 0; }
    .header h2 { font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin: 0; font-weight: normal; }
    .meta { font-size: 13px; color: #555; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .meta table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    .meta td { padding: 4px 8px; vertical-align: top; }
    .meta td:first-child { font-weight: bold; width: 120px; }
    .body-text { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .body-text p { margin: 0 0 12px 0; }
    .statute-box { background: #f8f8f0; border-left: 4px solid #c0392b; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .statute-box strong { color: #c0392b; }
    .footer { border-top: 1px solid #ccc; padding-top: 16px; margin-top: 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #666; }
    .urgency-critical { color: #c0392b; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .urgency-high { color: #e67e22; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .urgency-normal { color: #27ae60; font-weight: bold; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    {{#if isFollowup}}
    <div class="banner">7-DAY AUTOMATED FOLLOW-UP (Persistence Bot)</div>
    {{/if}}
    {{#if isEscalation}}
    <div class="banner">14-DAY AUTOMATED ESCALATION (Persistence Bot)</div>
    {{/if}}
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Legal Notice</h1>
      <h2>Under {{statute}}, {{section}}</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="meta">
      <table>
        <tr>
          <td>Date:</td>
          <td>{{dateISO}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>To:</td>
          <td><strong>{{officerName}}</strong>, {{officerDesignation}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>From:</td>
          <td>{{citizenName}} (via Actionable Justice OS)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Reference:</td>
          <td>Grievance #{{grievanceId}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Urgency:</td>
          <td><span class="urgency-{{urgencyLower}}">{{urgency}}</span></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="body-text">
      <p>Dear <strong>{{officerName}}</strong>,</p>

      <p>
        I, <strong>{{citizenName}}</strong>, am writing to bring to your
        notice the following matter under your jurisdiction (PIN: {{pin}}).
      </p>

      <p><strong>Statement of Facts:</strong></p>
      <p>{{factsBrief}}</p>

      <div class="statute-box">
        <strong>Applicable Law:</strong><br />
        {{statute}} — {{section}}<br />
        <em>This notice is served under the above provision and demands
        appropriate action within the time prescribed by law.</em>
      </div>

      <p>
        I request you to take cognizance of the above facts and initiate
        appropriate action as mandated under the applicable law. Kindly
        acknowledge receipt of this notice and inform me of the steps
        being taken.
      </p>

      <p>
        Please note that failure to act within the prescribed timeline may
        result in escalation to your supervising authority and filing of
        a formal complaint through CPGRAMS / appropriate legal channels.
      </p>

      <p>
        Yours faithfully,<br />
        <strong>{{citizenName}}</strong><br />
        Sent via Actionable Justice OS
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>
        This notice was auto-generated by Actionable Justice OS on {{dateISO}}.
        Grievance ID: {{grievanceId}}. Category: {{category}}.
        The statute and officer were determined via AI-assisted legal research
        grounded in Indian Kanoon and Government of India databases.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you believe this notice was sent in error, please contact
        support@actionablejustice.dev.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
